{"id":"6732cc79345a420e","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-recursive-closed.md","title":"Recursive Sets Closed Lemma","display":"lem-recursive-closed — Recursive Sets Closed Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-recursive-closed","aliases":["88-lem-recursive-closed"],"display":"lem-recursive-closed — Recursive Sets Closed Lemma","depends_on":["[[88-df-decidable-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-recursive-closed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-recursive-closed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-recursive-closed — Recursive Sets Closed Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (number sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> (decidable/recursive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}closed} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(B)\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Decidable}(A\\cap B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(A\\cup B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}closed} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(B)\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Decidable}(A\\cap B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(A\\cup B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>递归集（可判定集）的特征函数对布尔合取、析取和否定封闭</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Decidable}$ (decidable/recursive-set predicate, see [[88-df-decidable-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}closed} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(B)\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Decidable}(A\\cap B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(A\\cup B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\n\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":818,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["a6c52aed1a56207b"]}